+## Subtopics
+
+### TraGraph-GS
+Defines edges between Gaussians based on feature matching or geometric intersection. [Link](14454-tragraph-gs.md)
+
+### Gaussian Mixture Tree Construction
+Merges primitives into parent nodes using statistical or spatial criteria. [Link](16717-gaussian-mixture-tree-construction.md)
+
+### Mipmap-GS
+Modifies Gaussian parameters dynamically based on view-dependent factors like zoom level. [Link](16893-mipmap-gs.md)
+
+### Hierarchical Anchor Coupling
+Uses hierarchical structures to couple Gaussians. [Link](17260-hierarchical-anchor-coupling.md)
+
+### Self-Organizing Gaussian Grids
+Organizes Gaussians into a grid structure. [Link](19022-self-organizing-gaussian-grids.md)
+
+### Surface-Aware Splat Graph Construction
+Defines edges based on geometric intersection. [Link](22007-surface-aware-splat-graph-construction.md)
